OL,3,AHarry and Meghan 'surprised' by King's
OL,4,Aletter making clear they remain
OL,5,Anon-working royals
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the Duke and Duchess
OL,8,Fof Sussex says the couple were
OL,9,Fsurprised to see a letter sent on
OL,10,Fbehalf of King Charles clarifying that
OL,11,FPrince Harry and Meghan remained
OL,12,Fnon-working royals.
OL,14,FThe spokesperson said the couple, who
OL,15,Fhave recently moved back to the UK,
OL,16,F"were a little surprised not to have
OL,17,Fbeen told about this in advance".
OL,19,FBut royal sources say Prince Harry and
OL,20,FMeghan were made aware of the letter,
OL,21,Fsent on Monday afternoon, before it was
OL,22,Fmade public.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
