OL,3,AInvestigation after female staff at
OL,4,AEiffel Tower replaced by men for
OL,5,Areligious visit
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Women were asked to leave their places
OL,8,Fof work" and felt "humiliated", staff
OL,9,Funion representative Diane Davoine
OL,10,Fsaid. The tower closed on Monday as
OL,11,Fstaff went on strike to show their
OL,12,Foutrage.
OL,14,FAriel Weil, who is the president of the
OL,15,Fcompany that runs the tower, blamed its
OL,16,Fmanagers for being "a bit overzealous"
OL,17,Fin complying with the request without
OL,18,Fconsidering whether it was
OL,19,F"inappropriate".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG16/41
